        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I started lifting at 17 to get better at football and kept going after the football stopped. I have coached for eight years, first on a gym floor and now mostly online, with a few clients in person in Ruzafa.</p><p>I am qualified in strength and conditioning and I keep learning. What I care about most is that you still train in five years.</p>"
          }
